One thing that is in Omega, and IMHO should be added to NetHack (it
shouldn't be too hard), is that if there is a pile of stuff, it has a
different symbol ("*" in Omega) than a single object does.  This would
be nice, since a pile of stuff should look different from a bunch of
armour, scrolls, potions, weapons, etc, that just happens to have a wand
on top!  Maybe if "0" isn't used for anything else, it could be used as
the default pile symbol; GUI versions could have a nice pile icon...

